# M3a 固定协议向量；每个文件一个新设备。
> JF2 TXN BEGIN 1 0 0
< JF2 ERR SAFE_MODE HELLO required without faults
> JF2 HELLO 1 a
< JF2 ERR UNSUPPORTED unsupported protocol
> JF2 HELLO 2 z
< JF2 ERR BAD_ARG invalid nonce
> JF2 HELLO 2 7f3a
< JF2 OK HELLO fw=0.1.0 proto=2 caps=led,sw,txn,lease chips=2 board=v01 boot=* epoch=0 state=ARMED reset=por nonce=7f3a
> JF2 INFO
< JF2 OK INFO fw=0.1.0 proto=2 caps=led,sw,txn,lease chips=2 board=v01 boot=* epoch=0 state=ARMED reset=por brightness_cap=64 lease_default_ms=0 max_ops=256
> JF2 PING 12
< JF2 OK PING 12 up=*
> JF2 SELFTEST 0
< JF2 OK SELFTEST 0 result=pass
> JF2 SELFTEST 1
< JF2 ERR UNSUPPORTED no sensing hardware
> JF2 SELFTEST 2
< JF2 ERR UNSUPPORTED no sensing hardware
> JF2 CFG GET brightness_cap
< JF2 OK CFG GET brightness_cap value=64
> JF2 CFG GET lease_default_ms
< JF2 OK CFG GET lease_default_ms value=0
> JF2 CFG GET max_ops
< JF2 OK CFG GET max_ops value=256
> JF2 CFG SET brightness_cap 20
< JF2 ERR UNSUPPORTED no maintenance mode
> JF2 NOTREAL
< JF2 ERR UNSUPPORTED unknown command
> JF2 PING 01
< JF2 ERR BAD_FRAME expected canonical unsigned integer
> JF2  INFO
< JF2 ERR BAD_FRAME expected printable ASCII and single spaces
> JF2 SW STATUS
< JF2 OK SW STATUS epoch=0 crc=aa075363 c0=00000000000000000000000000000000 c1=00000000000000000000000000000000 state=ARMED
